@startuml
title D03 - Project A regeneration at the existing safe boundary
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

start
:UI / material / map event marks pending request;
:Coalesce slider changes;
:Enter existing safe world preparation boundary;
:Capture synchronized inputs and request revision;
:Collect accepted static source domains;
:Clip ordinary geometry into grid-local patches;
:Keep projector cycles as passthrough;
:Build groups, member aliases, bounds and coverage;

if (Geometry, PMFs and resource budgets valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Discard temporary data and report failure;
  if (Installed data is still semantically compatible?) then (yes)
    :Keep installed data;
  else (no)
    :Report / defer preparation explicitly;
  endif
  stop
endif

if (Relevant captured inputs are still current?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Discard obsolete temporary data;
  :Keep later request pending;
  stop
endif

:Stage replacement through existing LightManager / RHI;
if (Complete replacement ready for this boundary?) then (yes)
  :Install one complete group generation;
  :Acknowledge only processed request;
  :Retire old storage through existing lifetime mechanism;
else (no)
  :Report replacement failure without partial publication;
  stop
endif

:Ordinary frames update emission parameters only;
stop
@enduml
